<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Admission Letter - <%= student.full_name %></title>
    <link
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
        background: #fff;
        color: #000;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .a4 {
        width: 210mm;
        min-height: 297mm;
        max-height: 297mm;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 20px 30px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        background: #fff;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .header-logo {
        width: 150px;
        height: 150px;
        display: inline-block;
        text-align: center;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }
      .header-logo img {
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 100%;
        object-fit: contain;
      }
      .signature-placeholder {
        width: 200px;
        height: 60px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .signature-placeholder img {
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 100%;
        object-fit: contain;
        mix-blend-mode: multiply;
      }
      .letter-head {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .letter-body {
        text-align: justify;
        line-height: 1.5;
        font-size: 11pt;
      }
      .letter-body p {
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .table {
        font-size: 12px;
        margin: 15px 0;
        text-align: left;
        word-spacing: normal;
      }
      .table th,
      .table td {
        padding: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #000;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .heading {
        color: red;
      }

      /* Print styles for A4 */
      @page {
        size: A4 portrait;
        margin: 0;
      }

      @media print {
        html,
        body {
          width: 210mm;
          height: auto;
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0;
          background: #fff;
          print-color-adjust: exact;
          -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        }
        .a4 {
          width: 210mm;
          height: 296mm;
          min-height: 296mm;
          max-height: 296mm;
          margin: 0;
          padding: 7mm 9mm 6mm;
          border: none;
          box-shadow: none;
          overflow: hidden;
          page-break-after: avoid;
          page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
        .no-print {
          display: none !important;
        }
        .a4 > .text-center h2 {
          font-size: 17pt;
          line-height: 1.05;
        }
        .a4 > .text-center p,
        .a4 > .row {
          font-size: 8.5pt;
          line-height: 1.15;
        }
        .a4 hr {
          margin: 2mm 0;
          opacity: 1;
        }
        .a4 > .mb-3 {
          margin-bottom: 1.5mm !important;
          font-size: 9pt;
        }
        .a4 > .mb-3 p {
          margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .letter-body {
          font-size: 9.6pt;
          line-height: 1.24;
        }
        .letter-body p {
          margin-bottom: 1.8mm;
        }
        .letter-body h6 {
          margin: 0 0 2mm;
          font-size: 9.5pt;
          line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .table {
          width: 100%;
          margin: 2mm 0;
          font-size: 7.8pt;
          line-height: 1.1;
          table-layout: fixed;
          text-align: left !important;
        }
        .table th,
        .table td {
          padding: 1.2mm;
          vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .footer {
          margin-top: 1.5mm;
        }
        .header-logo {
          width: 28mm;
          height: 28mm;
        }
        .signature-placeholder {
          width: 35mm;
          height: 11mm;
          margin-top: 0;
        }
        .footer p,
        .bankers p {
          margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .bankers {
          font-size: 8pt;
        }
        .letter-body p,
        .footer,
        .bankers,
        .table {
          break-inside: avoid;
          page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Print and Navigation Controls -->
    <div class="no-print text-center mb-3">
      <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn btn-primary me-2">
        <i class="fas fa-print me-1"></i>Print Letter
      </button>
      <a href="/student/dashboard" class="btn btn-secondary">
        <i class="fas fa-arrow-left me-1"></i>Back to Dashboard
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="a4">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-info heading">
          NSAWKAW COLLEGE OF EDUCATION
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-0 text-danger">
          (AFFILIATED TO THE UNIVERSITY OF CAPE COAST - UCC)
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="row text-center mb-1">
        <div class="col-4 text-start">
          <div class="fs-6 fst-italic">
            In case of reply the number and date of the letter should be quoted
          </div>
          <p class="mb-0">TEL: +233(0) 507970090</p>
          <p class="mb-0">EMAIL: info@nsacoe.edu.gh</p>
          <p class="mb-0">OUR REF: NSCE/ADM/25</p>
          <p class="mb-0">YOUR REF:</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 text-center">
          <div class="header-logo">
            <img src="/css/images/logo.jpg" alt="NSACOE Logo" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 text-end mt-3">
          <p class="mb-0">POST OFFICE BOX 1</p>
          <p class="mb-0">NSAWKAW-TAIN DISTRICT</p>
          <p class="mb-0">BONO REGION</p>
          <p class="mb-0 mt-3"><%= admissionDate %></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <!-- Letter Info -->
      <div class="mb-3">
        <p><strong>ADMISSION NO:</strong> <%= student.admission_number %></p>
      </div>

      <!-- Letter Body -->
      <div class="letter-body">
        <p>Dear <strong><%= student.full_name %></strong>,</p>
        <h6 class="fw-bold text-decoration-underline text-center">
          OFFER OF ADMISSION<br /><%= academicYear %> ACADEMIC YEAR
        </h6>

        <p>
          1. You have been offered admission at
          <strong>Nsawkaw College of Education</strong> to pursue a 4-year
          programme leading to the award of
          <strong>B.Ed. Primary Education</strong> from the University of Cape
          Coast (UCC). You are to report on campus for the <%= academicYear %>
          academic year on <strong><%= reportingDate %> by <%= reportingTime %></strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          2. Your admission is for the <%= academicYear %> academic year only. If you fail
          to enroll or withdraw from the programme without prior approval from
          the college authorities, you will forfeit the admission and the fees
          automatically.
        </p>

        <p>
          3. The fee for the first semester of the <%= academicYear %> academic year is
          <strong
            >Five Thousand, Three Hundred Ghana Cedis (GH¢ 5,300.00)</strong
          >
          including residential facility user fees and examination fees. Please
          make full non-refundable payment of the fees on or before
          <strong><%= feeDeadline %></strong> to secure your place in the
          College.
        </p>

        <p>
          Note that the College will not accept physical cash. You may pay your
          fees at any of the following banks nationwide:
        </p>

        <table class="table table-bordered">
          <thead class="table-light">
            <tr>
              <th>BANK NAME</th>
              <th>ACCOUNT NUMBER</th>
              <th>ACCOUNT NAME</th>
              <th>BRANCH</th>
              <th>VIA</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Ghana Commercial Bank (GCB)</td>
              <td>7111130001820</td>
              <td>Nsawkaw College of Education</td>
              <td>Wenchi</td>
              <td>Eagle Pay</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Consolidated Bank Ghana (CBG)</td>
              <td>2216537640001</td>
              <td>Nsawkaw College of Education</td>
              <td>Techiman Wenchi Road</td>
              <td>Standardized Platform</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>
          A snapshot of your bank payment receipt(s) should be sent via WhatsApp
          to <strong>0597671371</strong> or <strong>0263742044</strong>. On
          arrival, submit the original payment receipt, admission letter,
          acceptance form, and results slip/certificate immediately to the
          Finance Office of the College.
        </p>

        <p>
          4. Your WASSCE result(s) shall be verified at WAEC, and if any
          discrepancies are detected in your results and/or identity, you will
          be dismissed instantly from the College without prejudice to any legal
          action that may be taken against you.
        </p>

        <p>5. Congratulations on your admission.</p>

        <div class="footer">
          <div class="signature-placeholder">
            <img src="/css/images/signature.png" alt="Principal Signature" />
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>Prof. Augustine Oppon-Kumi</strong><br />(College Principal)
          </p>
        </div>
        <hr />
        <div class="bankers">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-6">
              <p>BANKERS: CBG & GCB</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6">
              <p>ADMISSION: In Progress</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
